{
    "title": "Speedometer: GPS Speed Tracker",
    "description": "Ultimate GPS Speedometer with navigation precision! \u23f1\ufe0f\r\n\r\nNavigation accuracy: GPS Speedometer calculates how fast you are going! This is the best GPS Speedometer & Odometer because it uses a speed meter & distance measure that gives high precision accuracy. While driving, you will get the precise average speed. By installing our car Speedometer - Speed Meter, you will not get a single speeding ticket.\r\n\r\n\u23f1\ufe0f Car speedometer also tells you how fast you are driving. In our speed tracker, KPH and MPH units are used. The GPS speedometer & odometer app shows your current speed. In some places, the car speedometer is also called \"how fast am I going\".\r\n\r\nIn the GPS Speedometer & Odometer app, you can see your driving distance & speed. This GPS Speedometer gives you a reasonable estimate of the gas cost on top of all other features! While on the drive, you can also check how fast you are driving by using the kph or mph tracker\r\n\r\n\r\nGPS Speedometer & Odometer app is used to monitor the speed and distance, and it is a unique kph & mph tracker. Do you ever ask yourself \"How fast am I going?\" - If yes, you just found the solution! GPS Speedometer & Odometer!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 GPS Speedometer checks your speed in miles and kilometers. It gives you your current speed. Also, a car speedometer & odometer is used for speed and distance measure.\r\n\r\nGPS speedometer app as a speed tracker for walking, jogging and running. You can speed test a car or speed test a bike and stop getting speeding tickets. Use it while you cycle, and you have a cyclometer.\r\n\r\nGPS speedometer uses the exact formula for distance measure. GPS speedometer gives you the distance in kilometers, meters, and miles. You can also check your uber or taxi driver's distance from you in miles or kilometers, and you will know when the driver will arrive.\r\n\r\nThis speed tracker is used to check your speed in miles and kilometers. Discover why our GPS speedometer is a top-class car speedometer with precise data that will fill all your needs from an Odometer or Speed Tracker app.\r\n\r\nA car speedometer keeps all the information about your trip and uses a car miles tracker to check how fast your car is going. The GPS Speedometer gives details about your vehicle with the kph or mph tracker.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d<b>Here are the key features of GPS Speedometer & Odometer:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Simple but powerful Speedometer\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Compass\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Distance tracker - Odometer\r\n\u2714\ufe0f My location\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Route Finder\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Average speed\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Digital Speedometer\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Measures the distance traveled\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Speed tracking / Speed Meter\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Monitor distance precisely with GPS\r\n\r\nUse our GPS Speedometer offline because it works without internet access. It uses GPS to measure speed and distance. On a GPS speedometer, you can also set the speed limit.\r\n\r\nThis is a GPS car Speedometer and speed tracker app that measures the speed of all kinds of transportation in kph(kilometer per hour), mph(miles per hour), knot, or m/s in real-time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25Speedometer - GPS Odometer & Speed Tracker \ud83d\udd25\r\nSpeed tracker measures the speed of a car, train, bike, in a word, everything that moves! GPS Speedometer, Odometer, and speed limit app is the car kph or mph tracker with many features in which you can test the speed limit of all about your car speed in mph, km/h, or knot & also check the location on the map while driving with mph tracker app.\r\n\r\n<b>Discover an offline GPS Speedometer - distance measurement tool and speed tracker!</b> Reliable and precise speed meter and distance tracker in one app!",
